# Gazebo Classic 11's legacy Iris plugin supplies IMU samples at about 400 Hz.
# Copter 4.7.1 requires the gyro backend rate to be at least 1.8 times the
# configured main loop rate, so the default 400 Hz loop cannot arm safely.
# Keep this override isolated from the built-in SITL and real vehicles.
SCHED_LOOP_RATE,200
